0..69 Comment "// The manifold placing a role at a site whose offer answers its row."
70..72 Comment "//"
73..151 Comment "// It witnesses a deployment the check admits: the site answers each entry the"
152..169 Comment "// role requires."
170..172 Comment "//"
173..250 Comment "// `gandr check` of this file reads the program `Manifold.artifact` names and"
251..329 Comment "// resolves `far` among its worlds. It finds the site\'s file among its imports"
330..404 Comment "// by the site\'s key, then judges `far`\'s row against the site\'s `offers`."
405..493 Comment "// `std.io.Console.Eff` is granted from the site\'s `Authority`. `store` is answered by a"
494..566 Comment "// module that a functor over `Model(Store) with sort V = String` takes."
567..569 Comment "//"
570..621 Comment "// - see: `offers.gandr` — the program it deploys"
622..678 Comment "// - see: `offers.site.gandr` — the site `far` runs at"
680..707 Comment "// The deployment theories."
